<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Distilled from Pier Cap Design 10-22.html (generated 2026-10-22T13:27:18+00:00); same case (canonical SHA-256 8b85bf2a1a3e) and C005 formula set (327838126d06) as the report; FBMP Pier_Fixed.XML (420e614aa8b9); cap notebook package 71ba1ddfc4ef.</p></text>
