</region>
<region region-id="547" left="41.12" top="10444.06" width="525.75" height="142.50" align-x="41.12" align-y="10444.06" show-border="false" show-highlight="true" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="#ececec" tag="">
<plot disable-calc="false" item-idref="3"/>
</region>
<region region-id="548" left="18.00" top="10594.56" width="572.00" height="38.50" align-x="18.00" align-y="10603.06" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Note" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Figure 3. Demand/capacity ratio of each distilled check (stems) against the limit (dashed line). It is a Mathcad plot of CheckGood and CheckNoGood, so it recalculates with the worksheet and a check turns red when its ratio passes 1.0.</p></text>
</region>
<region region-id="549" left="18.00" top="10641.06" width="572.00" height="50.00" align-x="18.00" align-y="10649.56" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Note" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Check numbers: 1–3 flexure (N, P, B); 4–6 minimum steel (N, P, B); 7–9 tension-controlled strain (N, P, B); 10–12 Service I (N, P, B); 13 shear at S; 14 longitudinal tension at N; 15 longitudinal tension at P; 16 longitudinal tension at B; 17 minimum transverse steel at M; 18 transverse spacing; 19 face steel area, largest; 20 face bar spacing, largest; 21 hook development.</p></text>
</region>
<region region-id="550" left="18.00" top="10697.06" width="572.00" height="38.50" align-x="18.00" align-y="10705.56" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Note" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Failing checks not recomputed here (tool): End U grid · pile envelope clearance: Conservative square pile envelope includes the current horizontal placement allowance, pile embedment and required clear gap, enlarged by bar radius. Review shape-specific and fabrication tolerances separately.</p></text>
</region>
<region region-id="551" left="18.00" top="10741.56" width="572.00" height="27.00" align-x="18.00" align-y="10750.06" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Note" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">The tool reports 67 PENDING items: 2 Service III and fatigue; 3 FDOT covers; 4 D-regions, end regions and the end grid; 58 actual-cage prerequisites behind the distilled checks (anchorage and closure, splices, load path).</p></text>
</region>
<region region-id="552" left="18.00" top="10774.56" width="572.00" height="15.50" align-x="18.00" align-y="10783.06" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Note" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Detailing and geometry flags: 50 pass, as reported by the tool.</p></text>
</region>
</regions>
